      "providerName": "Google (Gemini)",
      "providerColor": "#2563EB",
      "date": "2026-05-25",
      "text": "Launched the Managed Agents in the Gemini API in public preview. This enables developers to build and deploy autonomous, stateful agents that run in secure, isolated Google-hosted Linux sandbox environments. To learn more, see the Agents overview page and the Quickstart.",
